        공유
        <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="opacity:0.6"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg>
